  "description": "Pure C# GCDRNet inference: document image shadow removal / appearance enhancement. Self-contained ONNX graph engine with CPU SIMD (AVX-512/AVX2/NEON/Vector) and GPU (Vulkan, Metal) backends; no onnxruntime dependency. Accepts interleaved BGR24 / RGB24 / BGRA32 / RGBA32. Models ship separately in Sdcb.SimdGcdrNet.Models.",
